@host = http://localhost:5138

### ─── Courses ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Lecture 7 — paged list (default page=1, pageSize=10)
GET {{host}}/api/courses

### Lecture 7 — page 2, 2 per page
GET {{host}}/api/courses?page=2&pageSize=2

### Lab 7 – Task 3 — pageSize is capped at 50
GET {{host}}/api/courses?pageSize=1000000

### Lab 7 – Task 4 — price filter
GET {{host}}/api/courses?minPrice=50&maxPrice=70

### Lab 7 – Task 5 — count
GET {{host}}/api/courses/count

###
GET {{host}}/api/courses/1

### 404 — course does not exist
GET {{host}}/api/courses/9999

### 201 — create
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Docker Basics", "price": 40, "instructorId": 1 }

### 400 — empty title + negative price (ProblemDetails with "errors")
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "price": -5, "instructorId": 1 }

### 409 — duplicate title
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "C# Fundamentals", "price": 50, "instructorId": 1 }

### 204 — update
PUT {{host}}/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "C# Fundamentals (2nd Ed.)", "price": 55 }

### 204 — delete (404 if it does not exist)
DELETE {{host}}/api/courses/9999

### ─── Students ────────────────────────────────────────

### Lab 7 – Task 2 — paged students
GET {{host}}/api/students?page=1&pageSize=2

### 201 — register
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Omar Nasser", "email": "omar@example.com" }

### 400 — empty name + invalid email
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "", "email": "not-an-email" }

### 409 — duplicate email
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Another Ahmad", "email": "ahmad@example.com" }

### 204 — update email
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Ahmad Ali", "email": "ahmad.ali@example.com" }

### 404 — student does not exist
GET {{host}}/api/students/9999

### Lab 7 – Task 1 — courses for a student (1 SQL query)
GET {{host}}/api/students/1/courses

### ─── Enrollments ─────────────────────────────────────

### 201 — enroll (run twice → 409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 1, "courseId": 1 }

### 404 — student not found
POST {{host}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 9999, "courseId": 1 }
